WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.050
The Moon's month, from above.

00:02.750 --> 00:04.904
We are far above the north pole.

00:05.354 --> 00:10.930
The ring is the path the Moon takes round the Earth, once a month, thirty Earths out.

00:11.380 --> 00:18.922
Both worlds are drawn larger than they are here, so you can see that the Sun lights the same half of each of them, all the time.
